'''Victorious Skanda''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties: The Majestic Zeus]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

