==Trivia==
*The head sprites for both Skanda's Normal and Evolved Forms have faces on them that are never seen during gameplay due to being covered by his masks.
*[[wikipedia:Kartikeya|Skanda]] is the Hindu god of war and brother of [[wikipedia:Ganesha|Ganesha]]. The unit's high speed comes from how the bodhisattva [[wikipedia:Skanda|Skanda]] is associated with speed in Japan thanks to a story of him running quickly to defeat evil spirits who had stolen the Buddha's relics. In fact, the Japanese name of this bodhisattva, 韋駄天 ''Idaten'', can be used to mean "speedster".

